-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

OrbACE depends on MACE (https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace), installed as the
separate package mace-torch and not distributed with OrbACE. MACE is licensed
under the MIT License reproduced below.

The following parts of OrbACE are adapted from MACE:

  * orbace/modules/models.py, class ZBLAtomPair: adapted from ZBLBasis in
    mace/modules/radial.py.
  * orbace/modules/models.py, class OrbACE, and
    orbace/modules/atom_model.py, class AtomOrbACE: the assembly of the
    equivariant backbone from MACE's interaction, product and readout blocks
    follows the layout of MACE's own model class.

